From: PupJune2 <PupJune2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0000
Subject: CromIKO pop-up guard

Hold every pop-up and every redirect to another site first, before
Adblock Plus closes it or the page leaves, and let the user decide:

- "Block all pop-ups" is now the default of Site settings > Pop-ups
  and redirects, so pop-ups opened with a tap are held too, not only
  the ones without a tap. Adblock Plus no longer has to close them
  after they opened.
- A new navigation throttle holds the redirects of a tab to another
  site that the user did not ask for: without a tap, started by an ad
  script, or started by another site (a frame of an ad, the pop-up of
  the page). A tap on a link of the page goes through; so do form
  posts, reloads, back and forward.
- The redirects that Chromium blocks itself (frames that try to
  redirect the page, Cromite's tab-under blocking) join them.

Instead of the "Pop-up blocked" message, a CromIKO toast slides up
above the toolbar: the shield of the logo, "Pop-up held" or "Redirect
held", the address, a badge with how many are held, and "Open" on the
right. It goes away after 8 seconds (longer with the accessibility
setting), shows a bar counting down, pauses while touched and swipes
away. A tab in the background shows its toast when it comes back.

"Open" grows a little menu out of the toast with the star of the
mascot:

- Who runs the site: the circle and name of the provider (Google,
  Microsoft, Meta, Amazon, ...), "Hosted by GitHub" for services where
  anyone can make a site, the name of the ad network, or "Unknown
  provider". A list in the browser; CromIKO asks nobody.
- The whole address, and a trust score from 0 to 100 in a ring that
  fills up: trustworthy, trustworthy but tracks you, be careful or
  risky, with the reasons: on the Adblock Plus list, ad network,
  short links, not secure, IP address, look-alike letters, spam
  domain endings, hidden addresses, app downloads, tracking codes,
  forwarding, opened without a tap, trackers of the provider, same
  site. A Google login gets 80: not malicious, but it tracks you.
- Open (Open anyway when risky), Block, and Always allow on the site.
  Opening something on the Adblock Plus list lets its site through
  Adblock Plus until the browser closes. Several held ones page with
  arrows.

Everything takes the colors of the theme, so it follows the accent
color; the trust colors are green, amber and red, in light and dark.

